# fleet-telemetry may only publish vehicle data.
user telemetry
topic write tesla/#

# Pi5 maintenance scripts (update check) may only publish status.
user ops
topic write ops/fleet-telemetry/#

# Home Assistant reads both; it may announce its own status (MQTT integration birth message).
user homeassistant
topic read tesla/#
topic read ops/fleet-telemetry/#
topic readwrite homeassistant/status
